    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the aft cargo compartment lining, showing the decor panels, the ceiling attachment hardware, the compartment lighting and the restraint interface items.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the aft cargo compartment lining and its decor assembly. Use it to order lining panels, ceiling attachment hardware and compartment lighting items.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows the aft compartment looking forward from the aft bulkhead. The forward and bulk compartments use the same item numbers with different panel lengths and are covered on sheets 2 and 3. Item 10 is the flame penetration resistant decor panel and item 10A is the curtain rail kit deleted at the same standard. The anchor nut pitch at the ceiling changes with the panel standard, so item 20 quantity differs between sheets."
    },
